WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:04.480
<b>Helsinki, Suomus 
Allied Forces Northern Headquarters</b>

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.800
That concludes my report, Marshal Mannerheim.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.330
I'll get to the point, then.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:10.150
<b>Empire of Karlsland Army
Marshal Erhard von Manstein</b>

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:10.150
<b>Suomus Commander-in-Chief 
Marshal Klaus Mannerheim</b>

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:10.310
A new army group will be formed at Petersburg.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.380
A Petersburg army group?

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:17.920
We've decided to bring the Allied Forces' 
might to bear against the Grigori nest.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.990
Thus, we need a new army group.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.820
So it's finally time for a counterattack?

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.250
Suomus will be helping, as well.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.020
But you, the 502nd, will be the primary force.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.430
Our unit?

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.400
Yes.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.880
I'll brief you on details at a later date.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.780
Roger.

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:39.030
By the way, that Brave Witch from Fusou...

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.260
Um, Karibuchi?

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.580
Lieutenant Karibuchi Takami.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.990
<b>Episode 4
"If You Want to Fight, Get Stronger!"</b>

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:22.940
You're sure you don't want to tell 
them about Karibuchi-san?

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:26.230
You mean that she isn't
with us. It's her sister?

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:30.560
If I tell them, the Fusou supplies 
will be cut off, correct?

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:32.290
Very sly.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.530
Call it "strategic."

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.680
Finally time for the counterattack?

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:45.140
We've learned that we can destroy a nest.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.400
Of course.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:52.550
But we still haven't been told how the 
501st destroyed the nest, have we?

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:56.920
Krupinski is writing a letter to the 
501st's Hartmann right now

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:58.440
for more information.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.790
All that's left is our own strength.

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:05.370
Okay!

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:13.320
One.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:14.490
Two.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:15.830
Three!

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:19.900
Yes!

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.630
You're doing something interesting.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:22.620
Yes!

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.270
It's a training exercise my sister 
used to do all the time.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.640
The way you're doing it isn't very stylish.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:40.820
If you have better control over your magic,

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.650
you can cross like this, too.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.570
Please tell me how to do it, Rossmann-san!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:50.160
First, I shall test you to see if you're 
worthy of receiving my training.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.020
Test me?

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:52.990
All right, Rossmann-sensei!

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:56.670
But if you cannot pass in a week,

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.030
you will go back home.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:01.460
One week, huh?

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.880
Wake up, Kanno!

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:05.870
An enemy attack?!

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.380
No! Hikari is...

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.800
A week, huh?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:15.050
But what will Rossmann-sensei do for a test?

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.680
Now, spin it up.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:17.510
Yes!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.810
Keep the RPMs at 1,500.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:20.510
Right!

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.540
Your Unit seems displeased.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.290
Chidori isn't happy?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:39.490
No. Because of you, it cannot 
bring its full power to bear.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.370
Because of me?

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.170
Just as I thought.

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:54.430
We're having Orussian-style zakuski today.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:55.670
It looks so good!

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.000
I've never had anything like this!

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:00.980
Hey, I heard...

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:03.790
You've only got a week left.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.110
Don't say that!

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.550
I'm not here for a week.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:07.620
I'll be here forever!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.330
So you're getting shipped back, huh?

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:16.430
All right, set it to semi-automatic 
and hit that target.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:17.900
It's so small...

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:18.670
Ready.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:19.580
R-Right!

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:23.470
<i>Hold the gun close, and support 
it with your shoulder.</i>

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:25.210
<i>Silently pull the trigger.</i>

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:26.340
<i>And shoot!</i>

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.690
Your magical energy is weak.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:32.250
You cannot absorb the recoil, can you?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.270
Take five steps forward.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.190
R-Right!

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:40.910
Ready.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:43.260
Fire.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.600
Five more steps.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.330
Right.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:48.720
Five more steps.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:49.460
Right!

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:51.870
Five more steps.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:52.490
Right!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:54.580
I did it!

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:56.420
I didn't expect it to be so bad.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:00.440
You have an overwhelming 
lack of magical power.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:03.580
You're nowhere near the base level 
at which I can teach you.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.620
Then, the test...

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:06.460
You fail.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:09.760
In that case, I'll run twice 
as much in the morning!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.970
And my magical power will get—

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:12.970
No, it won't.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.500
Magical power is something you are born with.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.480
It isn't something you can change later.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.920
But I still have a week, don't I?

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.860
Let me continue the testing, please!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.400
Come this way, then.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.400
Right!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.600
Maybe it is impossible, after all...

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:28.470
See?

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.090
It's just as I said.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.980
Kanno, when did you get here?

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:37.290
It's so tall!

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.400
Go and fetch that.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:45.890
Right.

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:47.280
I'll go get my Unit.

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.250
No flying.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.160
Then, how?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.880
I'll show you.

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.730
Redistribute your magical power to your front,

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:58.770
and then distribute it appropriately 
to your hands and feet.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:02.380
If you properly control the parts that 
touch the wall, you can climb.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.770
W-We didn't learn that in school!

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:10.780
If you cannot do it, go home.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:14.630
If you cannot pass this test, I refuse 
to let you participate in the attack.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.660
What will you do?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:17.400
I'll do it!

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:18.820
<i>That's right.</i>

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:20.540
<i>I have to try!</i>

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.580
<i>I can't give up before I've even tried!</i>

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:29.990
Ow...

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:33.500
If you get it, bring it to me.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.730
Is that really a test?

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:42.050
It doesn't matter. If she fails, she's done.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:47.650
That is an interesting idea.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.040
But can she get it?

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.150
Probably not.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:55.860
But it's better for her that she 
understands that she cannot.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.220
It's the least you can do, huh?

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.030
What do you think, Flight Lieutenant?

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:04.250
If nothing else, she has more than 
enough guts and enthusiasm...

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.050
But her magical power is 
fundamentally too weak.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:11.030
She has lots of stamina, but she 
isn't cut out for fighting.

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.670
Then she's useless here, on the front lines?

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:14.850
Yes.

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:18.550
My hands are numb...

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.080
What's your problem?

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.510
If you aren't going to eat that, I will.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.470
I will eat!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.900
Hot!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.140
I'm sorry!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.650
<b>Second Day</b>

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.580
Hey, is she doing better than yesterday?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.610
Anyone could improve with a full day of work.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.820
You're worried about her?

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:39.740
No way.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:43.420
What?

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:48.060
Ow...

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:48.940
Hikari?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:49.980
Are you okay?

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.040
There's a bird's nest up there!

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:53.710
It's a chidori.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.540
The chicks are preparing to leave the nest.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:56.840
A chidori?

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.680
You don't get it?

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.750
Rossmann-sensei is telling you to give up.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:07.190
But if I get the hat off the top...

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:10.170
Idiot! There's no way you can get that!

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:11.440
Can you do it?

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.230
It's easy.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.540
Wow!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:21.070
Huh?

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:27.740
Even if you can do this, it's useless!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.470
But I have to do it.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.460
Just do it yourself!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.980
<i>Rossmann-sensei could do it!</i>

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:46.750
That's enough for today, right?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:47.690
You look tired.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.040
Let's hit the saunas.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.220
The saunas?

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.930
When you're tired, the sauna is the best place.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:54.280
Close the doors!

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.570
You're lowering the temperature!

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:57.030
Right!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:01.200
I heard sensei's giving you a hard time.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.030
Nao-chan's worried about you.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:05.280
I am not!

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:06.480
Hey, Karibuchi.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.440
Throw some water on the rocks 
to raise the temperature.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:09.370
Right!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.450
So cold!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:17.960
That was deliberate, wasn't it?!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.000
No!

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.270
<b>Third Day</b>

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.250
I'm sorry...

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.130
I'll stay away from you.

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.780
She doesn't learn.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:41.760
She is still at it.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:44.100
She made it farther up than yesterday.

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:46.460
What will you do if she pulls it off?

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:49.630
She fell.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.870
<b>Fourth Day</b>

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:53.740
I know!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.160
So that's her plan?

00:10:58.940 --> 00:10:59.950
She fell.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.840
<b>Fifth Day</b>

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.490
What's wrong, Hikari?

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:04.890
Why aren't you eating?

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:08.010
I thought if I were a little 
lighter, I could go higher.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.720
You're a <i>Dreadnought</i>-class idiot, aren't you?

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.260
No good...

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:16.830
I'm too hungry to do it...

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.320
<b>Sixth Day</b>

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.710
I need to eat a lot!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.410
She's getting really tired.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.530
She's been using all her magic power for days.

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:28.280
That isn't normal.

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:29.510
She stopped.

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:35.630
Hikari!

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:40.220
She fell asleep.

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:45.060
Jeez, now she's making us work.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:48.750
What's the point of that test?

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:50.440
Are you worried about her?

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.350
No, but...

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:54.550
What?

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:57.030
I promised that if she could 
get the hat off the tower,

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.820
she could join the attack.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:02.350
If she cannot do even that, she would 
die in combat, if she joined.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:12.000
<b>Neuroi

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:18.510
Huh?

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:20.910
What am I doing in my room?

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:24.350
You're starting at this hour?

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:25.900
Rossmann-sensei!

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.330
Come with me.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.800
Hikari-san, what kind of 
Witch do you want to be?

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:34.660
What kind?

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:38.300
I want to be a great Witch, who helps 
everyone, like my big sister!

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:39.750
That's impossible.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:41.530
Why?

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.440
I once taught a girl like you,

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.440
who wanted to fight, no matter what.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.650
She was very serious and 
very enthusiastic, but...

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:53.570
Her magical power was weak?

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:54.680
Yes.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.750
I knew she wasn't cut out for combat.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.590
But I gave in to her enthusiasm, 
and let her fight the Neuroi.

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:04.620
What happened to her?

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.860
She was never able to fly again.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:11.400
On the battlefield,
people lacking combat ability

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.090
bring only sadness to themselves 
and those around them.

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.590
But was she really sad?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:22.980
Sensei, if I'll cause problems for 
others, I'll go back to Fusou.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:26.150
But if I can help, even a little,

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.420
I want to stay here!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.450
Then...

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.620
I know!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:30.880
I have to get the hat, right?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.160
Let me try until the last minute!

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:36.830
Do as you want.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.590
Okay!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.290
<b>Seventh Day: The Final Day</b>

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:42.040
The wind's strong.

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.870
And today is her last day.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.680
She has bad luck.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.090
Hikari!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.310
What?

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.400
I'm glad I didn't hit the nest...

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.280
Hey, are you okay?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.310
The nest is fine!

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.280
Jeez.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.270
Ow...

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.580
Higher up, the wind is stronger.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.750
Hikari...

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.880
Hey, you can't do it in this wind.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.820
Ask Rossmann-sensei for another day—

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:28.550
No. There will be no extensions.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:29.710
Rossmann-sensei...

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.710
There isn't much time left.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:32.770
Right!

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:35.850
Stop.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.250
And let your legs hang there.

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:38.550
I'll fall!

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:39.490
Just do it.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:42.470
Focus the magic power your feet 
were using into your hands.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.230
Okay!

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.560
Is that possible?

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:48.330
What are you thinking, Sensei?

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.110
<i>Focus on my hands...</i>

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:55.690
I did it! I did it!

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:57.690
Now let your left hand go.

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:01.820
You don't have the magical power to 
distribute throughout your body.

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:04.530
But you can focus it in one spot.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.170
Right!

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:12.560
Wow, she's only using one hand?

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:16.300
Put your magical power in your left hand, 
and then switch before you fall.

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:17.810
Use only your hands to climb.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:18.840
Okay!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.360
She...

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.390
Now, right.

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:23.050
Okay!

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:23.660
Left.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.330
Okay!

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:24.890
Right.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:25.440
Okay!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.470
Wow.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.230
She's climbing... She's climbing!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.340
She's using just her hands.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.320
What?

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:38.490
Weren't you going to make her give up?

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:42.950
True, given her lack of magic 
power, this is all she has.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.580
But even if she uses this to pass your 
test, it will be hard from now on.

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.580
She just doesn't know when to give up.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.660
I see...

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.170
And you like that in a student?

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.520
You can do it, Hikari!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:08.110
<i>It's so cold, my hands are becoming numb.</i>

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:13.610
The Suoyarvi base, north of Lake Ladoga,

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.910
has detected a medium-sized 
Neuroi coming from the east.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:18.870
All Witches, prepare to sortie.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:19.920
Neuroi?!

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:25.160
I wish I could've gone with her.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:29.450
I'm so close...

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.780
I forgot something.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.420
H-Hey, Kanno!

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.060
I'm out of energy...

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:41.780
Hey, you!

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.380
Kanno-san?

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.490
How long are you going to stay at base?

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.380
You're pissing me off!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:52.250
You know there isn't any way you 
can make it into the 502nd!

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.780
We can't know until we try!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.000
We do know.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.660
If you try hard and fail, you'll fail 
the rest of your life!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:59.030
I'm not a failure!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.000
I said that you're a failure!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.370
I'm not a failure!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.210
You are!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.460
I'm not!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.080
Give up and return to Fusou, you failure!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.210
I'm not a failure!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:08.770
You're a failure!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:09.740
I'm not a failure!

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:10.380
You're a failure!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.150
I'm not a failure!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:11.940
You're a failure!

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.070
I'm not a failure!

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:14.250
I'm not a failure!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:15.290
I'm not a failure!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:17.700
I'm not a failure! I'm not a 
failure! I'm not a failure!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:18.900
I'm not a failure!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:20.800
I'm not a... failure!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.140
You did it, after all.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.330
Kanno-san...

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:34.910
You passed.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:36.820
Sensei!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.750
We're sortieing. Get ready.

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:42.550
Right!

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:47.200
Launching!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.550
Chidori's totally different than before.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.130
It sounds happy!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:57.740
That is the true form of the Shiden Kai.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:58.690
Sensei!

00:17:58.690 --> 00:17:59.680
Let's go.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:00.170
Right!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.180
Neuroi sighted.

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.040
Kanno, heading in first!

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:07.370
Forwards, attack.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.630
Flying Officer, support them!

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:09.470
Roger!

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:12.570
Okay... Let's go!

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.500
You're too far forward!

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:26.190
Where's the core?

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:31.260
It's no good. I can't see it.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:31.910
Huh?

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:33.660
It's Hikari!

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:35.310
She did it!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.980
You're late.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:42.610
Hikari-san...

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.460
You cannot be your sister.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:50.440
Keep dodging the attacks until you're 
close enough to hit the enemy.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.310
Be yourself.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.380
Okay!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:00.710
Right!

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:03.210
Left!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.170
My body's moving the way I want.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:10.290
I've become one with Chidori!

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:13.980
Wow!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.160
She's dodging it!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.560
The Shiden Kai is spinning like it should.

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.990
She's concentrating her power in the Unit.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:21.340
Is it thanks to her training?

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.250
That's Rossmann-sensei for you.

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:39.690
I can see the core!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.320
The core?

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:47.870
Hikari found the core!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.400
Now that we know where the core is...

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:07.070
Wow, Hikari!

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.980
Beginner's luck, I guess.

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:10.300
You saw the core?

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:11.730
Yes, I did.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:14.290
I saw it when we collided,
just like last time.

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:15.930
When you collided with it?

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:19.940
You're sure?

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:20.810
Yes.

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:24.230
It seems she can see the cores by 
making contact with the Neuroi.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:25.860
I've heard rumors of this.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:30.360
Karibuchi Hikari, it appears you have 
the unique magic of Contact Eye.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:31.680
Contact Eye?

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:33.350
But never use it.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.160
Why?

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:35.770
If I have magic eyes—

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.370
Don't throw away your life.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:40.720
Why do you think Takami used that technique?

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:41.660
Which technique?

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:44.280
The Absolute Eye. You haven't heard of it?

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:45.750
The Absolute Eye?

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.340
She didn't want to worry you, huh?

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.510
I heard the story during the Battle of Libau.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:55.850
It's a powerful technique, which lets 
you see multiple Neuroi cores,

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.270
or special-type cores, in an instant.

00:20:58.390 --> 00:21:01.670
But it heavily stresses mind and body,

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:04.760
and it badly weakens your shields.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.910
So using it without support is suicide.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:12.100
Don't let the sacrifice Takami made to 
protect you and the fleet be wasted.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.740
Sis...

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:15.990
So that's what she did.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:17.210
Listen.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.960
No using the Contact Eye.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:19.720
Got it?

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:22.200
Understood.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:26.390
Sis... Chidori...

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.720
I made it into the 502nd.

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:36.560
Hikari, congrats!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:39.810
I'm disappointed I didn't get the Shiden Kai.

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.570
I'll become stronger!

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:47.860
You need to keep flying.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:51.270
And to become your own person.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:55.000
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.500
The temperature keeps dropping!

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:30.070
-20... -30...

00:23:30.070 --> 00:23:31.750
How could it get cold so quickly?

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:33.960
Is that a Neuroi?

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:36.790
Next time on <i>Brave Witches</i>: 
Deadly Battle in the Freezing Cold.

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:38.930
Survive, no matter what's going on around you!

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Episode 5
"Deadly Battle in the Freezing Cold"</b>
